Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:59:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tower interior: replace PSX placeholder rooms with the
 DRIFTER sprite kit

- add 37 cut-out sprites in assets/game/interior/ (floor, walls, doors, windows, props)
- interior.js now builds each room from billboard sprites on the same iso camera as the overworld
- interior_layout.js holds placement, scale, collision, glows and interaction points
- main.js reads interaction points from the layout and uses new spawn points
