+// ===== DRIFTER — RELAY TOWER INTERIOR LAYOUT (sprite kit) =====
+// Data only. Edit coordinates here; interior.js reads it.
+//
+// Coordinates are LOCAL to the interior origin (IX,IZ):  x runs toward the camera's right-down,
+// z toward the camera's left-down, y is height.  Room is 14 x 14 (3 x 3 floor tiles of 4.667).
+// The back wall sits at z = -7, the left wall at x = -7; the two near sides are open (cutaway).
+//
+// DEFS[name]  w,h = source px   ax,c = ground anchor (0..1 from left / from BOTTOM)   W = on-screen width in world units
+// item        k = sprite name (assets/game/interior/<k>.png)   x,z,y   flip = mirror the sprite
+//             layer: floor | decal (flat, always under objects) | wall | wallart | (default) prop
+//             solid: [rx, rz] collision half-extents around (x,z)
